extends layout

block content
  .row.page-header(style="margin-bottom: 20px;") 
    .col-lg-12
      h1(style="margin-top: 20px;") Apollo Diagnostics
      img(src="/image/logo1.jpg", alt="logo", style="width: 150px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 10px;")

  .row
    .col-xs-12.col-md-9
      .row
        .col-xs-12.col-sm-6
          p.rating
            span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star
            span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star
            span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star
            span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star-empty
            span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star-empty
          p Apollo Diagnostics
          .panel.panel-primary
            .panel-heading
              h2.panel-title Suggestions
            .panel-body
              p Diet: Maintain a proper and balanced diet.
              p Exercise: Exercise everyday as burning calories is essential.
          .panel.panel-primary
            .panel-heading
              h2.panel-title Opening hours
            .panel-body
              p Monday-Sunday 24/7 
          .panel.panel-primary
            .panel-heading
              h2.panel-title Facilities
            .panel-body
              span.label.label-warning 
                span.glyphicon.glyphicon-ok 
                | &nbsp;Diagnostics
              | &nbsp; 
              span.label.label-warning 
                span.glyphicon.glyphicon-ok 
                | &nbsp;Scanning
              | &nbsp; 
              span.label.label-warning 
                span.glyphicon.glyphicon-ok 
                | &nbsp;First-aid 
              | &nbsp; 
              span.label.label-warning 
                span.glyphicon.glyphicon-ok 
                | &nbsp;Pharmacy
              | &nbsp; 
              span.label.label-warning 
                span.glyphicon.glyphicon-ok 
                | &nbsp;Medical Services
              | &nbsp; 
        .col-xs-12.col-sm-6.location-map
          .panel.panel-primary
            .panel-heading
              h2.panel-title Location map
            .panel-body
              <iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d121832.20409658122!2d78.50324833466358!3d17.399479757431745!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bcb9947dafe460d%3A0xc59e9d243f1b6339!2sApollo%20Diagnostics!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1727410404961!5m2!1sen!2sin" width="400" height="300" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
      
      .row
        .col-xs-12
          .panel.panel-primary.review-panel
            .panel-heading
              a.btn.btn-default.pull-right(href='/location/review/new') Add review
              h2.panel-title Customer reviews
            .panel-body.review-container
              .row
                .review
                  .well.well-sm.review-header
                    span.rating
                      span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star
                      span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star
                      span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star
                      span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star
                      span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star
                    span.reviewAuthor   S Neha
                    small.reviewTimestamp   18 August 2024 
                  .col-xs-12 
                    p Apollo Diagnostics provided a seamless and professional experience, with punctual sample collection and timely report delivery. The staff’s courteous and skilled approach made the entire process comfortable and stress-free.
              .row 
                .review
                  .well.well-sm.review-header
                    span.rating
                      span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star
                      span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star
                      span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star
                      span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star-empty
                      span.glyphicon.glyphicon-star-empty
                    span.reviewAuthor    Y Yamini 
                    small.reviewTimestamp   01 July 2024
                  .col-xs-12 
                    p Apollo Diagnostics impressed me with their efficient service and accurate results. The friendly staff and clean facilities made my visit pleasant and reassuring. 
    .col-xs-12.col-md-3 
      p.lead 
        |Apollo Diagnostics is on MedFinder as it has good facilities with doctors and medical services. 
      p 
        If you've been and you like it - or if you don't - please leave a review to help other people just like you.

